/// 季末前夜「劫兆」三选：备粮 / 祭刀 / 闭门。赶路触发，一季一次。不改夜巡、迷障、渡劫 Boss。
const kJiejiEveStockMoney = 80
const kJiejiEveStockMoneyThunder = 50
const kJiejiEveStockHerb = 3
const kJiejiEveStockLife = 4
const kJiejiEveRiteLife = 2
const kJiejiEveHideLife = 8

function _jiejiEveSeasonId() {
  if (game.jieji != null && game.jieji.seasonId != null) {
    return game.jieji.seasonId
  }
  return null
}

function _jiejiEveStockMoneyCost(seasonId) {
  if (seasonId == 'thunder') return kJiejiEveStockMoneyThunder
  return kJiejiEveStockMoney
}

function _jiejiEveCostLife(want) {
  var lost = want
  final life = hero.life ?? 1
  if (life - lost < 1) lost = life - 1
  if (lost < 0) lost = 0
  if (lost > 0) {
    Player.setLife(hero.life - lost)
  }
  return lost
}

function _jiejiEveNormalizeKind(kind) {
  if (kind == 'stock' || kind == 'jieji_eve_stock') return 'stock'
  if (kind == 'rite' || kind == 'jieji_eve_rite') return 'rite'
  if (kind == 'hide' || kind == 'jieji_eve_hide') return 'hide'
  return null
}

function _jiejiEveChoices() {
  return [
    {
      text: 'jieji_eve_stock',
      description: 'hint_jieji_eve_stock',
    },
    {
      text: 'jieji_eve_rite',
      description: 'hint_jieji_eve_rite',
    },
    {
      text: 'jieji_eve_hide',
      description: 'hint_jieji_eve_hide',
    },
  ]
}

function _jiejiEveApplyRiteFury() {
  final jieji = ensureJiejiFlags()
  if (jieji.arrayFury == true) {
    jieji.feastFury = true
    return 'feast'
  }
  jieji.arrayFury = true
  return 'array'
}

function _jiejiEveMark() {
  final jieji = ensureJiejiFlags()
  final seasonId = _jiejiEveSeasonId()
  if (seasonId == null) return
  jieji.lastEveSeasonId = seasonId
}

/// 季末前夜劫兆三选。debug.forceEve 直接走这里，仍弹出三选。
async function playJiejiSeasonEve() {
  if (hero == null) return false

  _jiejiEveMark()

  dialog.pushDialog('hint_jieji_season_eve')
  dialog.pushSelection('jiejiSeasonEve', _jiejiEveChoices())
  await dialog.execute()
  final picked = dialog.checkSelected('jiejiSeasonEve')
  var selected = _jiejiEveNormalizeKind(picked)
  if (selected == null) {
    selected = 'hide'
  }

  final seasonId = _jiejiEveSeasonId()
  if (selected == 'stock') {
    final cost = _jiejiEveStockMoneyCost(seasonId)
    final moneyHave = hero.materials['money'] ?? 0
    if (moneyHave < cost) {
      dialog.pushDialog('hint_jieji_season_eve_stock_broke', interpolations: [cost])
      await dialog.execute()
    } else {
      Player.exhaust('money', cost)
      await Player.collect('herb', kJiejiEveStockHerb, incurIncident: false)
      final healed = Player.restoreLife(kJiejiEveStockLife)
      dialog.pushDialog('hint_jieji_season_eve_stock', interpolations: [
        cost,
        kJiejiEveStockHerb,
        healed,
      ])
      await dialog.execute()
    }
  } else if (selected == 'rite') {
    final lost = _jiejiEveCostLife(kJiejiEveRiteLife)
    _jiejiEveApplyRiteFury()
    dialog.pushDialog('hint_jieji_season_eve_rite', interpolations: [lost])
    await dialog.execute()
  } else {
    final healed = Player.restoreLife(kJiejiEveHideLife)
    final jieji = ensureJiejiFlags()
    jieji.illusionVeil = true
    dialog.pushDialog('hint_jieji_season_eve_hide', interpolations: [healed])
    await dialog.execute()
  }

  Game.updateUI()
  return true
}

/// 赶路触发：当季余日 1～2，且本季还没出过劫兆。出过则返回 true，本步不再滚野遇/赶路/行商。
async function tryJiejiSeasonEveOnMove() {
  if (hero == null) return false
  if (game.jieji == null) return false
  final remain = game.jieji.daysRemaining
  if (remain == null) return false
  if (remain > 2) return false
  if (remain <= 0) return false
  final seasonId = _jiejiEveSeasonId()
  if (seasonId == null) return false
  final jieji = ensureJiejiFlags()
  if (jieji.lastEveSeasonId == seasonId) return false
  await playJiejiSeasonEve()
  return true
}
